              "creation_time": "2026-05-26T08:53:48Z",
              "creator": "bfarkas@mozilla.com",
              "id": 18103881,
              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows 10\nFirefox version: Firefox 140.10.1esr (esr) / Firefox Nightly 153.0a1 (2026-05-25)\n\n**Preconditions:**\n- Clean profile\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Navigate to: https://www.tiktok.com/de-DE/\n2. Resize the browser window to a smaller width or change the zoom level until the up/down navigation arrows disappear \n3. Attempt to scroll up or down using the mouse wheel\n4. Observe the page\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nThe scroll functionality works accordingly\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nMouse scrolling is unresponsive\n\n**Notes:**\n- Reproducible on the latest Firefox Release and Nightly\n- Reproducible regardless of the ETP setting\n- Works as expected using Chrome\n\n---\n\nCreated from webcompat-user-report:2731c8e7-4f8b-4be2-8e12-696e5f7204b5",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
              "text": "Created attachment 9589656\nUnresponsive scroll Nightly vs Chrome\n\n**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows 10\nFirefox version: Firefox 140.10.1esr (esr) / Firefox Nightly 153.0a1 (2026-05-25)\n\n**Preconditions:**\n- Clean profile\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Navigate to: https://www.tiktok.com/de-DE/\n2. Resize the browser window to a smaller width or change the zoom level until the up/down navigation arrows disappear \n3. Attempt to scroll up or down using the mouse wheel\n4. Observe the page\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nThe scroll functionality works accordingly\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nMouse scrolling is unresponsive\n\n**Notes:**\n- Reproducible on the latest Firefox Release and Nightly\n- Reproducible regardless of the ETP setting\n- Works as expected using Chrome\n\n---\n\nCreated from webcompat-user-report:2731c8e7-4f8b-4be2-8e12-696e5f7204b5",
